        {
          "question": "What does 'adult care home level of care' actually mean?",
          "answer": "This means your loved one needs daily help with activities like bathing, dressing, medication management, or mobility, the same level of assistance provided in licensed adult care homes. A doctor must verify this on the FL-2 form based on clinical assessment."
        }
